<title>INDIA: India Reliance Capital 6-mth net higher.</title>
<headline>India Reliance Capital 6-mth net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    597.0  vs    532.0</p>
<p>    Total Income	1,076.6  vs   1,070.7</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	 9.64 vs	 9.21</p>
<p>    Expenditure	   115.7  vs	53.3</p>
<p>    Interest costs	147.0  vs	36.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  216.9  vs     448.6</p>
<p>    Tax*		    nil    vs     nil</p>
<p>Note: Finance firm Reliance Capital Ltd said provision for taxation would be made at the end of the year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
